                <head>Analyses by American Diplomatic Missions of political events in Europe of
                    special interest to the United States in connection with the maintenance of
                    peace</head>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>Proposed Danubian accord; Anglo-French London conversations, February 1–3;
                        proposed “Eastern Locarno” pact; Stresa Conference, April 11–14; proposed
                        “Western European Air Locarno” pact; German rearmament program</p>
                </quote>







































































